{"id":"f758d129bfa15228","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-propositional-compactness.md","title":"命题满足关系的紧致性","display":"thm-propositional-compactness — 命题满足关系的紧致性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-propositional-compactness","aliases":["72-thm-propositional-compactness"],"display":"thm-propositional-compactness — 命题满足关系的紧致性","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §1.1.5, print8–9/PDF20–21; source statement and topological proof read","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-propositional-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-propositional-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-propositional-compactness — 命题满足关系的紧致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §1.1.5, print8–9/PDF20–21; source statement and topological proof read"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fml}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fml}\\)</span> 可无限；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Asn}=\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Asn}=\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ A⟧_a\">\\(⟦ A⟧_a\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a>。元理论为 ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是有限子集族。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl[\\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\exists a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\ \\forall A\\in\\Delta\\ (⟦ A⟧_a=1)\\bigr]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\ \\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\ (⟦ A⟧_a=1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl[\\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\exists a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\ \\forall A\\in\\Delta\\ (⟦ A⟧_a=1)\\bigr]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\ \\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\ (⟦ A⟧_a=1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §1.1.5 的同一陈述。逐公式赋值集合是乘积空间 2^PV 的柱集布尔组合，因公式只读有限多个坐标而闭且开。左式给这些闭集的有限交性质；ZFC 中紧致离散二点空间之乘积紧致，故全交非空。反向限制同一满足赋值即可。这个证明依赖一般乘积紧致性，没有声称在任意弱元理论中已消除该原则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fml}$ 可无限；$\\mathsf{Asn}=\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}$ 与 $⟦ A⟧_a$ 取 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]。元理论为 ZFC；$[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}$ 是有限子集族。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fml}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Asn}=\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ A⟧_a","display":false},{"tex":"[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl[\\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}\\ \\exists a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\ \\forall A\\in\\Delta\\ (⟦ A⟧_a=1)\\bigr]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\ \\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\ (⟦ A⟧_a=1).","display":true}],"bytes":1604,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admis